{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53205","headline":"诗偈 三十 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛教本无妄，句句须论实。\n尅己饶益他，俗所谓阴骘。\n遮莫是天王，饶君宰相侄。\n世间有贵贱，业力还同一。\n语汝富贵人，贫儿莫欺屈。\n习重业力成，翻覆难得出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}